      "note": "The four-clause structure (veteran + not-dishonorable + income/net-worth + wartime service + one of age/disability/nursing-home/SSDI-SSI) maps to an allOf-of-anyOfs. But the income-AND-net-worth test is a combined asset test with statutory exclusions, and the wartime-service test is date-keyed and multi-branch -- both fold into booleans the interview cannot ask."
