      { "kind": "incorporated-law", "text": "The wartime-period list (Mexican Border through the Gulf War, still open) and the date-keyed service-length rules." },
      { "kind": "professional-assessment", "text": "'Permanent and total disability' determination." },
      { "kind": "other", "text": "Countable income is gross family income minus certain deductions (notably unreimbursed medical expenses over 5% of MAPR) -- so the effective income test is not a figure a person can self-check." }
